{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b6c9a71a283e58957dcfb330a0bc6734b2b38605327a88ca6d50318c81254330", "ja": "昴、少し時間いいか？\nファンレターが届いてたから渡しておくよ。", "zh": "昴，有空吗？\n有封粉丝来信，拿去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "dab91ef2df0390b90ca0d5eb3be707087c73f0af7a23a345880dccd8b37f1b2f", "ja": "えっ？　ホントに！？　スッゲー嬉しいよ！\nどれどれ……ふんふん、へぇ～……♪", "zh": "诶？真的！？我超开心的！\n我看看……嗯嗯，哦～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "eca706a84139a92788a0169ec57825d478e2f144bdc97a3100640e8ea33d1ec6", "ja": "……って、えーっ！？\n{$P$}、この内容……！", "zh": "……诶，等等——！？\n{$P$}，这内容……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1003_null", "source_sha256": "f82be56bdbf52b4c0c91f5c1dc31df0135386ebbb7d0c3dbc6b858fbf2efb392", "ja": "「（中略）おねえさん、すごくカッコよかったです。\nおとなになったらぼくとケッコンしてください！」", "zh": "「（略）大姐姐，你真的太帅气了。\n等我长大以后请和我结婚！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "cceb9960603e460b00f307b5c1b09c14a1edfcc64a3985543fad02fb6b4f925d", "ja": "オレこういうの苦手なんだよ～！\nうう、どう返事したらいいのかなー……？", "zh": "我不擅长应付这种事啊～！\n呜呜，该怎么回答才好呢——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1005_p", "source_sha256": "be8ad3b42dde9ec9a52c6ab9474bf567d0eaff979d9d952e67231c3409462b25", "ja": "そうだなぁ……まあ小さい男の子みたいだし、\nそこまで悩むことはないとは思うけど。", "zh": "是啊……不过看起来就是个小男孩，\n我觉得没必要为这种事烦恼到那种程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "794b39af1f059e210a6a3f24bdc4b50f1be3e7e6abd47a4ba74e2f090f25b8e6", "ja": "い、いや、こういうのって大事だろ！？\n真剣に返事しないとさ～！", "zh": "不、不是，这种事可是很重要的吧！？\n必须得认真回复才行啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "0d8f89669a72f670c796636ea8e199a349c29d15fb6fb353855ff889716389b6", "ja": "ゴメン！　オレ、アイドルだから……。\nこれだと傷ついちゃうかな？　うーん、うーん！", "zh": "抱歉！我可是偶像嘛……\n这样会不会伤人呢？嗯——嗯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0222_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bdb6332600bef3de59d8d8f9b95dbbcda593573a3881975e42fafee293d32c68", "ja": "（一人一人のファンに、真剣に向き合う姿勢。\nそういうところも、昴の魅力なんだろうな）", "zh": "（认真对待每一位粉丝的态度。那种地方，大概也是昴的魅力吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
